<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessels loading and movements at July 16.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessels loading and movements at July 16.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry and independent surveyors detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel		Date of Arrival   Quantity     Destination</p>
<p>TRADE ANIMATION     25/06/97	   10,000	  Africa</p>
<p>PRADU		   27/06/97	    4,200	  Indonesia</p>
<p>BANGKHONTHI	   27/06/97	    7,200	  Indonesia</p>
<p>XYRUS		   30/06/97	    1,200	  Island</p>
<p>XUAN CHENG	    01/07/97	   13,000	  Island</p>
<p>SHANGTHAI QUARTZ    02/07/97	    3,750	  Island</p>
<p>SHANGTHAI JEWELLERY 02/07/97	    6,150	  Island</p>
<p>SONG THUONG	   04/07/97	    8,600	  Italy</p>
<p>TO YO		   04/07/97	    4,545	  Vietnam</p>
<p>KEN SUN		 08/07/97	   18,000	  Iraq</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
